# Title: Exports Critical Registry Keys To a File
# ID: 82880171-b475-4201-b811-e9c826cd5eaa
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Oddvar Moe, Sander Wiebing, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-12
# Tags: attack.exfiltration, attack.discovery, attack.t1012
# Description: Detects the export of a crital Registry key to a file.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process.command_line:* -E *) AND ((process.command_line:*hklm* OR process.command_line:*hkey_local_machine*)) AND ((process.command_line:*\\system OR process.command_line:*\\sam OR process.command_line:*\\security)) AND ((process.executable:*\\regedit.exe) OR (process.pe.original_file_name:"REGEDIT.EXE")))
